    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1689349663\" /></span><br><br>Astrality is a rail shooter in where you will have to shoot and defeat the enemies in front of you while you avoid their bullet-hell style attacks and the obstacles that you will come across. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1689349663\" /></span><br>Navigate, shoot enemies, and dodge relentless attacks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/b3265203a827fb29e45a3c3f1237078b.poster.avif?t=1689349663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/b3265203a827fb29e45a3c3f1237078b.webm?t=1689349663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/b3265203a827fb29e45a3c3f1237078b.mp4?t=1689349663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unleash your shooting skills, defeat enemies, and conquer obstacles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/a438dbe0fa219bbf76f3363d16520522.poster.avif?t=1689349663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/a438dbe0fa219bbf76f3363d16520522.webm?t=1689349663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485620/extras/a438dbe0fa219bbf76f3363d16520522.mp4?t=1689349663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Conquer the cosmic battlegr